      <article class="research-feature research-feature--split">
        <figure class="research-figure">
          <a href="/images/research/refbound-v8-figure-2.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/images/research/refbound-v8-figure-2.webp" width="1808" height="1302" alt="SIMPLE 拆成两次解码调用。LOCAL 保留一次四列投影，在注意力内部按 3+1 拆分查询。图中也展示了状态提交和后续调用。" loading="lazy"></a>
          <figcaption><span>图 2 · LOCAL 跨视图执行</span><a href="/images/research/refbound-v8-figure-2.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看大图 ↗</a></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="research-copy">
          <p class="about-meta">RefBound · arXiv:2610.03228v8</p>
          <h3 id="heterospec-title" lang="en" translate="no">Recovering Parallelism under Fixed Numerical References in Quantized LLM Decoders</h3>
          <p class="about-role">独著 · 预印本</p>
          <p>量化解码时，注意力所需的 KV 缓存视图可能在一组查询中发生变化。LOCAL 保留符合固定数值参考的并行投影组，在注意力内部按物理视图拆分查询，再按原顺序合并输出。</p>
          <p>在 RTX A5000 上使用固定候选序列的 32B 视图跨界实验中，LOCAL 从验证到状态提交的耗时比整次调用拆分基线低 21.56%（95% 置信区间为 20.21%–22.83%）。非跨界主对照的估计降幅为 0.43%，95% 置信区间跨零。</p>
          <div class="about-entry-links"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.03228v8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">arXiv ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/leecdiang/RefBound/tree/de2192a5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">代码与实验材料 ↗</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>
